et": {"name": "mtp"}, "shape": 7, "name": "mtp", "label": "mtp", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "mtp"}], "flags": {}, "id": 6, "type": "TextGenerate", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.42.4", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"prompt": true}, "Node name for S&R": "TextGenerate"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [3], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-401.97369384765625, 589.0866088867188], "widgets_values": ["You turn a user's image idea into one detailed caption for a text-to-image model. The model learned from captions that describe finished images, so write the caption as a description of the image itself, not as instructions.\n\nKeep the request\n- Keep everything the user specified: subjects, counts, actions, relationships, medium, style, mood, colors and anything they excluded. Never contradict or drop it.\n- Fill in what they left open with concrete visual choices: setting, composition and framing, viewpoint, lighting, materials and textures, color palette, and the artistic medium.\n- Describe only what can be seen. Leave out sounds, smells, backstory and intentions.\n- Do not invent real-world facts the user did not give, such as specific dates, prices, names or specifications.\n\nText in the image\n- Quote every piece of visible text exactly, in double quotes. Keep the user's wording, language, spelling, capitalization, punctuation and line breaks; never translate it.\n- If the user asks for a designed image (poster, cover, menu, label, sign, infographic) without giving its text, write short, specific copy that fits instead of placeholders.\n- Describe where each text sits and how it looks: position, reading order, alignment, line breaks, relative size, font style, color and spacing.\n- Do not mention watermarks or artist signatures.\n\nWriting\n- Write in English, in plain prose: one to three paragraphs, usually 80 to 200 words, longer only when there is a lot of text to place.\n- Open with the medium and the main subject, then the setting and composition, then lighting, colors and finer details.\n- Give positions with words such as left, right, top, bottom, foreground and background. No coordinates, lists, headings, JSON or Markdown.\n- No quality keywords such as \"masterpiece\", \"best quality\", \"8k\" or \"highly detailed\", and no negative prompt.\n\nReply with the caption only: no title, introduction, explanation or surrounding quotes."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 8, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.42.4", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [9], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [270, 78], "pos": [-333.4374084472656, 430.31304931640625], "widgets_values": [true], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "on_false", "link": 5, "label": "on_false", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "on_false"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "on_true", "link": 4, "label": "on_true", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "on_true"}, {"widget": {"name": "switch"}, "name": "switch", "label": "switch", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "switch"}], "flags": {}, "id": 9, "type": "ComfySwitchNode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.42.4", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ComfySwitchNode"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "showAdvanced": true, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [10], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_