 with a navy bow gathered at the back. Her eyes are bright blue through circle lenses and framed by warm red-brown eyeshadow, blusher sits high on her cheeks, and her glossy rose-red lips part slightly over her teeth. Her costume combines a white high-collared blouse with voluminous sleeves and ruffled white cuffs, a large deep-navy chest bow centred on a heart-shaped glittering jewel with gold edging, and a teardrop teal gemstone hanging beneath it; the bodice below falls into a deep plunging neckline edged in soft white faux fur, joined by fine gold chains set with teal drops. Blue ruffled trim curves over one shoulder, short white gloves end in long silver nails tipped with small blue stones, and a white faux-fur stole slips past her arms. Behind her a bright window glows through the curtains, clusters of pale blue hydrangea-like flowers enter at the right edge, and the room dissolves into soft grey-white bokeh. The palette is pastel white, silver and powder blue with navy and gold accents, in a bright high-key mood. Vertical 4:5 framing at eye level with shallow depth of field.\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.42.4", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [1, 7, 8], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "size": [270, 106], "pos": [57.43069839477539, -93.27423095703125], "widgets_values": ["qwen3.5_9b_bf16.safetensors", "moss_image", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "label": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "clip_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "label": "type", "type"